WEBVTT

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:07.060
So what are you doing here, Kokonotsu?

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.820
Well... Um... It started snowing
when I was heading home.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.820
So... I'm waiting for the
train to resume running.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:18.700
I see... Then maybe I'll wait with--

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.870
May I have your attention, please?

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:26.210
Due to the snowy conditions,
all delayed trains have been canceled.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:28.210
We apologize for the inconvenience.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.710
This isn't good.

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.410
It really is Hotaru...

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:42.180
I can't believe I ran into
her in a place like this.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:45.980
There were so many things that
I wanted to say to her, but...

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.360
But... why...?

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:54.490
Um... Um...

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:58.620
What... What were you doing?

00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:02.370
There's something I need to take care of,
so I was on my way there by train.

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:07.830
I didn't mean that.
What have you been doing since then?

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:12.340
Well... all sorts of things.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:16.840
Like helping the family business...
I've been pretty busy.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:22.220
I bet you were able to do a lot
of things while I was gone, too.

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:26.850
I'd love to hear all about it!

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:30.560
I went to the shrine and the bus stop.

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:33.190
I went to other places, too.

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:36.240
But no one was there.

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.950
I even began to wonder if
you ever really existed.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:43.350
I had irrational thoughts like that.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.870
Why didn't you say anything?

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:49.740
Kokonotsu...

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.380
I did a lot of things while you were gone.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.920
Our shop was in trouble.
There are more people around now.

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:02.260
Just when I got used to things
and started to find it fun...

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:08.850
...I realized that I had forgotten about
my dream... and I totally panicked.

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:12.860
I had my manga reviewed
at a review event today.

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:15.860
It was the first time I had someone
take a serious look at my manga.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.610
But it was a total disaster.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:22.320
I started thinking that...
maybe I should just give up.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.580
Dammit! This isn't what I wanted to say.

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:29.080
All I'm doing is taking things out on her!

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:33.760
I just wanted her to see that
I'd changed when we met again.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:36.080
And now that we meet after all this time, I...

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:38.030
I know how you feel.

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:44.050
I've got just the thing for the
distressed Kokonotsu I see before me!

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:50.890
This lead-in... Is she gonna
start talking about dagashi?

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:55.860
Its name is Super Mario-kun Comic Gum!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.940
"Super Mario-kun Comic Gum"

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.570
See? I knew--

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:02.200
Wait, S-Super Mario-kun?!

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:12.830
"Super Mario-kun Comic Gum"

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:05.410
Not only do you get to enjoy some tasty gum,

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:09.000
but also a chapter of the
Super Mario-kun manga!

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:09.910
There are ten chapters in total,

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:12.830
and moreover, one of those ten chapters
hasn't been published anywhere else!

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.040
Whoa...!

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:22.090
And if I do this... Whoa!
It really became a manga!

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:26.600
"Super Mario-kun"

00:03:22.300 --> 00:03:26.600
Having to assemble it makes it seem
like a model, which is exciting, isn't it?

00:03:26.930 --> 00:03:30.020
By the way, it's put out by Top Seika,
the same manufacturer who makes

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:31.990
Super Scary Story Gum.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:32.560
"Super Scary Story Gum"

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:35.040
Makes sense, doesn't it?

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.620
Oh? What's the matter?

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:40.610
Ah, nothing.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.680
It almost makes too much sense.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.590
Hm...? Ahhh!

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:00.800
I'm sorry! I'll stop right away!

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:04.800
You're able to stop crying
on demand, Kokonotsu?

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.490
I'm sorry.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:11.710
I think all sorts of feelings I had
bottled up started pouring out as tears.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.560
I'm glad...

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:20.900
...that you had time to seriously
think about what you like.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:25.410
Well, it's not my place to tell you
whether you should give up or not.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:30.620
What's important is that you made your decision
after trying it and thinking carefully about it.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.910
But the Kokonotsu that
I see before me now...

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.420
...doesn't appear to have
completely given up yet.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:42.520
I'm not sure about it myself.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:48.010
But... maybe I just wanted
to feel down for now.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:51.520
I'm sure that's also important.

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:54.850
Kokonotsu...

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:55.520
Hm?

00:04:56.730 --> 00:05:00.530
I'm sorry that I disappeared
on you so suddenly. And...

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:04.780
...I'm back. So once again,
it's been a while, hasn't it?

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:08.780
W-Welcome-- What?! Then...

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:11.990
At any rate, it's cold.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.540
Y-Yeah...

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.750
Oh, that's right! If I remember correctly,
I have that in my suitcase.

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:17.570
"That"?

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.270
Would you like to have some...

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:26.930
"Buta-men"

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.380
...Buta-men with me?

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:26.930
Wh-What's with that suitcase full of Buta-men?!

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.600
That's the only thing you took with you?

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:33.930
Now, let's put some snow from outside
in the kettle to make boiling water...

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.420
...and have some Buta-men!

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:40.440
We won't be able to leave here until
the first train in the morning anyway!

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.860
I-It's cold...

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:44.940
Let's hurry up!

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:48.450
Things I wanted to tell her...
Things that I wanted to ask her...

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:49.370
--Hotaru!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:50.160
--I thought I had a lot more, but...
--Hotaru!

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.490
--I thought I had a lot more, but...
--It really is cold, isn't it, Kokonotsu?

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:53.040
--It really is cold, isn't it, Kokonotsu?

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:57.460
"Buta-men"
"Distinctive Flavor of Rich Soup"

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.210
Well, I guess...

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.350
...I can ask her some other time.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:29.570
Hm?!

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.450
It's already morning.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.580
Hota... ru...?

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:49.930
Hotaru!

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:57.140
Good morning. What're you doing?

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:57.950
Ah, well...

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:01.650
Good question.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:04.820
More importantly, Kokonotsu,
the trains are back in service!

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:05.400
What?!

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:09.370
Now...! Let's go back to Shikada Dagashi!

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:13.910
I'm back!

00:07:14.330 --> 00:07:15.030
Ko...

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:15.740
Co...

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:17.410
Coconuts!

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.080
Were you okay? Did the trains stop?

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:22.790
Yeah. I'm sorry for worrying you guys.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.250
You really did! We came here today only
to find you still hadn't come home!

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:29.760
We couldn't even reach you via cell. Right?!

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.880
What?

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:33.890
Whoa! The battery is dead!

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:35.350
Kokonotsu...

00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:37.770
Welcome back.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:39.310
Thanks.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.560
Hajime... It was a total disaster.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:47.070
After everyone went to all
that trouble to help me...

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.570
Please don't worry about it.

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.240
Besides, one failure isn't the end of the world.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.030
You don't have to be so down.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:56.330
Yeah, there's always next ti--

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.080
Hm?

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:57.830
Ah...?

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:58.580
Oh?

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.710
It's been a while, everyone!

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.580
Wha... What?

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:09.760
Whoa! It really is Hotaru!

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:12.550
You think there's another woman like me?

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:14.590
Why exactly are you doing that?

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:17.220
Manager... Manager Kokonotsu...

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:18.890
Yes?

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.310
Is she your acquaintance?

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.770
Oh, that's right. Ahh!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:23.370
Huh?!

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:25.460
Did you just...

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:27.110
Yes?

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.530
...call him "manager"?

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:31.110
Yes.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.860
What...? Ah!

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:35.320
I-It's not like that!

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.320
It's like a temporary thing.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.670
Hey, are you listening, Hotaru?!

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:45.460
I guess I wasn't wrong after all!

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:48.630
Even if it's temporary,
it was inevitable this would happen!

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:52.130
This is a result of the
unescapable grip of destiny!

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:55.880
The time has come, Kokonotsu!

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.760
I want you!

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:00.810
What?

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:02.390
What?!

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.350
What? What does that mean?

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.980
Hotaru?

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.650
You sure are a smooth operator,
aren't you, Manager...

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:12.570
Precisely! We can't let his talent
for smooth operation go to waste!

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:13.900
What? That's how you took it?

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.150
So...!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:17.820
I'm back! Kokonotsu! Did you mis--

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:22.580
For my company, I need
Kokonotsu more than Yo!

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:23.790
More than Yo!

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:26.540
What?

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:29.000
Your company?

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:32.460
That's right! I'm thinking of
creating my own company.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:36.550
In order to make my dream
come true, I need your talen--

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:39.970
Oh...

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:43.220
D-Dad! When'd you get home?!

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:44.560
Y-Yeah...

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:48.560
Well, right around when
she said "more than Yo."

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.560
What the heck is going on?

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:54.780
Young people hanging out at a
dagashi shop during the day?

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:58.290
What?

00:09:58.990 --> 00:09:59.690
Hm?

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:02.790
Big brother...

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:03.830
Hotaru!

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.080
Big brother?!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:06.830
Who's this guy?

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.210
Um... "Big brother"?

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:12.960
His name is Beniyutaka Shidare.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.840
"Beniyutaka Shidare"

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:17.590
He's my big brother who was supposed
to take over the Shidare Company.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.220
I never expected to see you in this town...

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:24.470
Big brother, where on earth have you been?

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:28.230
Argh! Come on!

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:31.480
I finally get out of the hospital,
and no one even cares!

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:30.810
My honey!

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:33.940
That sugar feeling, sugar feeling,
when I take a bite

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:33.360
There's a guy with a weird name in the shop!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.110
Hajime seems to be leaving her guard down!

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.780
That sugar feeling, sugar feeling flows into me

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:37.740
And it seems that Kokonotsu is
about to be taken by Hotaru!

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:44.700
The crackling sparkle is giving me a sugar rush

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:42.160
But I won't let anyone... take Kokonotsu!

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.450
Wait, Yo!

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.370
I must take issue with that remark.

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:50.040
I'm stuffed... I can't...
but I'm hungry for more!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:48.870
Kokonotsu is a candidate for the leader
of the part-timers at our store!

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:49.960
What?!

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:50.920
Big brother?!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:53.340
Those lips I longed for...

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:53.630
Kokonotsu is the successor to Shikada Dagashi!

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:56.550
They look like gelatin when they jiggle

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.920
Wait! Coconuts wants to create manga!

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.840
We've got so much manga
that we have to sell them!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:11:02.640
The words that come out shock
and sting me like ramune

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:00.720
What's gonna happen to the shop
if you're gone, Manager?

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:02.850
I'll follow Hotaru!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:12.520
The marshmallow with bitter
chocolate hidden inside is a little dull

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:03.470
--We've got so much dagashi
that we have to sell them!

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.430
--Geez...! I said Manga!
--We've got so much dagashi
that we have to sell them!

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:06.350
--The leader of the part-timers!

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:07.810
--Can we read all the dirty mags we want?!
--The leader of the part-timers!

00:11:07.810 --> 00:11:11.060
--Can we read all the dirty mags we want?!
--Like I said, Kokonotsu is going to...

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:11.520
Hm?

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:13.480
He's running away!

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:18.690
No matter how much I poke or tickle,
my feelings never get through

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:14.520
Ah!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:18.400
"Shikada Dagashi"

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.400
Ahh!

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:19.530
You're hungry?

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.030
Wh-Why me?

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:20.110
My honey!

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:21.610
That sugar feeling, sugar feeling

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:26.370
The more I chew, the deeper the flavor

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:25.280
Manager!

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:26.990
Coconuts!

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:28.000
That sugar feeling, sugar feeling

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:33.920
Before I knew it,
I was completely crazy about you

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:33.830
You've still got a ways to go, Kokonotsu.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.550
Don't fall behind!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:38.840
I'm stuffed... I can't...
but I'm hungry for more!

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:38.460
Ahh!

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.260
Hotaru...

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:47.780
Um...

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:49.630
This...

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:52.100
"Meito Homerun! (Won 1 free bar)"

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:54.770
Keep holding on to it for me.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:56.110
What?

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:00.610
So that I can come back to this place any time.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:03.820
Okay!

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:05.950
Well then...

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:07.990
Ahh! Hotaru!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:10.160
--It's dangerous! Both of you! Hey!

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:16.560
"Shikada Dagashi"
"I'm Back, Welcome Back, and..."

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:13.710
--Which dagashi shall we eat today?!
--It's dangerous! Both of you! Hey!
